WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.119 --> 00:00:05.120
Hey youtubers it’s charlie and recently
warner brothers announced dates for 9 mystery

00:00:05.120 --> 00:00:12.120
dc movies coming after Batman vs Superman.
So this video is going to be a breakdown of

00:00:12.730 --> 00:00:17.369
what those might be. About half of them are
pretty obvious choices like Superman and Batman

00:00:17.369 --> 00:00:21.680
sequels, it’s when we start thinking about
the other 4 or 5 that things get interesting.

00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:24.730
If you’re just finding me for the first
time I do marvel and dc videos every week.

00:00:24.730 --> 00:00:26.730
Be sure to subscribe to get everything.

00:00:26.730 --> 00:00:29.919
So let’s start with the actual list of dates.
I’m just going to read these off. Batman

00:00:29.919 --> 00:00:34.679
vs Superman just got moved forward to March
25, 2016. Warner Brothers decided that they

00:00:34.679 --> 00:00:38.829
didn’t want to compete with Captain America
3. Those two movies were set to come out on

00:00:38.829 --> 00:00:43.179
the same day. It was funny, when they made
the announcement. Marvel people were tweeting

00:00:43.179 --> 00:00:47.149
Captain America panels from the comics showing
him being a badass standing his ground.

00:00:47.149 --> 00:00:52.980
It’s all big movie studio business stuff,
the only reason I care is because we get to

00:00:52.980 --> 00:00:56.749
see Batman vs Superman two months earlier,
which is great. So you guys should think of

00:00:56.749 --> 00:00:59.229
Then we get into the mystery movies. Here’s
what they are:

00:00:59.229 --> 00:01:06.229
August 5th 2016, June 23 2017, November 17
2017, March 23 2018, July 27 2018, April 5

00:01:13.150 --> 00:01:19.420
2019, June 14 2019, April 3 2020, June 19
2020.

00:01:19.420 --> 00:01:25.820
What are all those movies, that’s a giant
list and why didn’t they announce names?

00:01:25.820 --> 00:01:29.520
The best theory I’ve seen is that Warner
Bros knew they were going to move Batman vs

00:01:29.520 --> 00:01:34.900
Superman and bow to Marvel. In addition Marvel
announced 6 new untitled films the week before

00:01:34.900 --> 00:01:38.910
comic con. So Warner Brothers just made the
announcement to save some face.

00:01:38.910 --> 00:01:45.910
Both studios absolutely do not care what each
other does. The DC people at Warner Brothers

00:01:45.960 --> 00:01:51.170
don’t care about Marvel and Marvel doesn’t
care about the DC Movies. But, the money people,

00:01:51.170 --> 00:01:53.900
the CEOs and board members of those companies
care a lot.

00:01:53.900 --> 00:01:54.710
So the people actually making these movies
usually have absolutely nothing to do with

00:01:54.710 --> 00:01:57.090
these types of announcements. Somebody in
a board room says, we need to make X Billion

00:01:57.090 --> 00:02:02.330
Dollars each year, so because these movies
make X dollars you need to release X number

00:02:02.330 --> 00:02:03.690
each year.

00:02:03.690 --> 00:02:08.369
It’s a financial thing. Which sounds kind
of silly and it is. But what are the movies

00:02:08.369 --> 00:02:12.999
going to end up being. Back in June there
was a list that supposedly leaked from inside

00:02:12.999 --> 00:02:13.870
Warner Brothers.

00:02:13.870 --> 00:02:20.870
It was that list of movies including Shazam
and the Green Lantern Flash Crossover. People

00:02:23.069 --> 00:02:28.049
were saying it was the list of movies Warner
Brothers was going to announce at Comic Con.

00:02:28.049 --> 00:02:30.840
That didn’t end up going down, maybe because
they saw Marvel wasn’t going to announce

00:02:30.840 --> 00:02:33.909
their mystery films, but whatever.

00:02:33.909 --> 00:02:40.909
That leaked list went as such, Shazam, Sandman,
Justice League, Wonder Woman, Flash/Green

00:02:42.480 --> 00:02:48.769
Lantern Team Up and Man of Steel 2. That’s
only 6 of the 9 but those are all movies that

00:02:48.769 --> 00:02:51.909
have been in development. Here’s what’s
going on with all of them.

00:02:51.909 --> 00:02:56.030
Shazam - The Rock has already said he was
developing a DC project with Warner Brothers

00:02:56.030 --> 00:02:59.299
a long time ago. Like several years ago they
met about him being Shazam but the movie never

00:02:59.299 --> 00:03:03.819
happened. But he’s still at the top of their
list. So think of it as a Rock Shazam movie.

00:03:03.819 --> 00:03:10.819
Sandman - There’s a big history with this
movie. Back in December of 2013 it was reported

00:03:12.109 --> 00:03:15.920
that David S Goyer, the guy who wrote the
first Man of Steel Movie was writing a script

00:03:15.920 --> 00:03:20.379
for Joseph Gordon Levitt to direct. Their
version was the Neil Gaiman Sandman, not the

00:03:20.379 --> 00:03:23.379
Wesley Dodds Sandman that was part of JSA.

00:03:23.379 --> 00:03:27.060
Before they came along, James Manigold, the
guy who directed the last Wolverine movie,

00:03:27.060 --> 00:03:30.310
was going to do it as a tv show on HBO. Imagine
what that would have been like. That was pre

00:03:30.310 --> 00:03:35.120
Game of Thrones, pre True Blood. So I’m
not surprised HBO didn’t move forward with

00:03:35.120 --> 00:03:35.870
it.

00:03:35.870 --> 00:03:42.870
And in case you heard about the CW tv series,
that’s for Hourman, not Sandman. I know

00:03:45.909 --> 00:03:50.689
the Flash hasn’t even started, but the CW
is also developing a Rex Tyler Hourman tv

00:03:50.689 --> 00:03:52.510
show.

00:03:52.510 --> 00:03:59.510
Justice League - We’ve actually heard a
bunch about this. Mostly that Zack Snyder

00:04:00.279 --> 00:04:04.029
is going to direct and the writer from Batman
vs Superman Chris Terrio, is going to write

00:04:04.029 --> 00:04:09.319
it too. So basically the same team that’s
doing Batman vs Superman is going to do Justice

00:04:09.319 --> 00:04:13.819
League. No surprise there. It just means Warner
Brothers really likes the stuff Zack Snyder

00:04:13.819 --> 00:04:20.819
has being doing with the movie so far.

00:04:23.000 --> 00:04:26.729
Wonder Woman - This would be Gal Gadot’s
solo movie. This is really hard to predict

00:04:26.729 --> 00:04:31.330
because they’ve been very secretive about
her role on Batman vs Superman. She wasn’t

00:04:31.330 --> 00:04:35.060
in the teaser trailer at comic con and they
only showed her costume. Which was exactly

00:04:35.060 --> 00:04:37.169
what earlier leaks had reported it to be.

00:04:37.169 --> 00:04:40.960
There was some images from the set of her
getting out of a car, but so far we know almost

00:04:40.960 --> 00:04:42.710
nothing about her character.

00:04:42.710 --> 00:04:46.199
I will go on the record as saying I like Gal
Gadot, but I’m going to withhold comments

00:04:46.199 --> 00:04:47.970
about her doing a solo wonder woman movie
until I see some footage of her in Batman

00:04:47.970 --> 00:04:50.979
vs Superman.

00:04:50.979 --> 00:04:55.090
The Flash Green Lantern Team up - This is
going to make some of you guys short circuit.

00:04:55.090 --> 00:04:58.190
Mostly because there’s no way they’re
going to let Grant Gustin be in the movie

00:04:58.190 --> 00:04:59.620
as the Flash.

00:04:59.620 --> 00:05:03.639
Geoff Johns already went on record during
comic con as saying the TV Shows and the Movies

00:05:03.639 --> 00:05:09.250
are separate universes and will continue to
be that way. At least until all the executives

00:05:09.250 --> 00:05:13.849
at warner brothers get fired and new ones
come in that want a shared universe.

00:05:13.849 --> 00:05:18.550
Everybody knows what went down with Ryan Reynolds
Green Lantern. I think we’d all rather see

00:05:18.550 --> 00:05:25.550
him in a Deadpool movie anyway. But Barry
Allen and Hal Jordan are both from Central

00:05:26.259 --> 00:05:29.750
City, so that’s probably why they’d want
to put those characters together in a movie.

00:05:29.750 --> 00:05:33.940
The Man of Steel Sequel. Originally that was
what Batman vs Superman was going to be, until

00:05:33.940 --> 00:05:37.889
they stuffed it so full of A List actors and
characters it mutated into a Justice League

00:05:37.889 --> 00:05:38.129
Prequel.

00:05:38.129 --> 00:05:45.129
So the next solo Superman movie will be 
a completely separate thing.

00:05:50.840 --> 00:05:57.169
Here’s my thoughts about that list. They’re
going to focus on the holy trinity fist. Superman,

00:05:57.169 --> 00:06:02.379
Batman, Wonder Woman, Justice League. All
of those movies will come out first. What’s

00:06:02.379 --> 00:06:06.699
happening with Justice League is they’re
basically rolling right into production after

00:06:06.699 --> 00:06:13.699
Batman vs Superman wraps. All of the same
people cast and crew are making both films.

00:06:25.599 --> 00:06:28.680
So if Batman vs Superman is successful, they’ll
want to release Justice League as soon as

00:06:28.680 --> 00:06:33.449
possible just to maintain people’s attention
spans.

00:06:33.449 --> 00:06:37.000
I totally think they’ll let Ben Affleck
write the next solo Batman film. He might

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:40.220
not have time to direct, but he’s a great
writer who is also a great director. So it

00:06:40.220 --> 00:06:43.650
wouldn’t be crazy for them to let him do
both. It would just be hard to do for a film

00:06:43.650 --> 00:06:48.120
that big. Directors on those movies basically
go without sleep for two years straight. Acting

00:06:48.120 --> 00:06:51.629
on top of that would make it almost impossible
without a life model decoy.

00:06:51.629 --> 00:06:56.759
What about the other mystery films? There
are still 3 we need to figure out.

00:06:56.759 --> 00:07:01.419
Right now the best rumors are for Metal Men,
Suicide Squad and Justice League 2. Of all

00:07:01.419 --> 00:07:06.159
those, Justice League 2 seems the most likely.
Sequels are always easier to get made than

00:07:06.159 --> 00:07:11.889
unfamiliar characters.

00:07:11.889 --> 00:07:18.889
As comic book fans, the Suicide Squad and
Metal Men are totally familiar, but think

00:07:19.669 --> 00:07:24.020
about this as if you had never read a comic
book in your life. That’s who movie studios

00:07:24.020 --> 00:07:30.719
think about, like the masses of people who
will have no idea who these characters are.

00:07:30.719 --> 00:07:35.360
Suicide Squad I totally buy as like an Expendables
type movie. If you ever saw John Carpenter’s

00:07:35.360 --> 00:07:41.969
Escape from New York or Escape from Los Angeles.
Snake Plissken gets dumped into an urban war

00:07:41.969 --> 00:07:44.580
zone with a kill switch wired into his brain.

00:07:44.580 --> 00:07:48.620
Amanda Waller did the same thing when Arrow
did their Suicide Squad episode last year.

00:07:48.620 --> 00:07:54.249
It was really cool. Basically an expendables
100 million dollar version of that Arrow episode.

00:07:54.249 --> 00:08:01.249
Just as an alternative to that Metal Men movie
I’d like to suggest a movie centered around

00:08:01.469 --> 00:08:06.009
